{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他被熟悉的亲近感打动，满心欢喜，想把藏着的话说出来，却始终没有开口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、紧张、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"粉色小字里的船舱失衡、两道声线、水波和倒数感不容易一眼读全；他为什么最终有所保留，尤其是怕让对方为难、破坏原有自在的顾虑，需要读灰色长句才能明白。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很想坦白藏着的心里话，也想留住眼前的亲近，但又怕破坏两人原本的自在，最后还是有所保留。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、欢喜、犹豫、珍惜、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"三条大字的主线比较容易找到，但灰色段落中怕说太多让对方为难的具体原因不容易在一眼内完整抓到；右上角图例太小，下方金色点线与人物处境的关系也不明确。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想把藏着的话说出来，想留住眼前的亲近，却又怕打破原有的自在，最终还是没有完全说出口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、紧张、舍不得、渐渐安静\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的三行粉色文字包含高音、喉咙发紧、船舱失衡、水波和话语回荡等多层信息，三秒内很难建立它们之间的关系；这些细节需要逐句读，才能理解音乐变化如何对应他的情绪变化。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字构成的情感主线其实比较清楚：熟悉的亲近带来欢喜，想坦白却怕破坏当下，最终有所保留。最大的问题是粉色补充文字与主线之间的层级关系不够明确，三个时刻从一行、消失到三行，尤其第三张增加的三行小字把音乐、船舱、水波等意象插在情感主线中间，增加扫读负担。下方金色点线动画能让人感受到音乐的流动，但无法直接看出它与人物的具体处境有什么联系。因此，人物的心动与犹豫能抓到，音乐画面和人物感受之间的连接则还差一点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1059760-db7c-4a4e-8e25-d36e6b9074fc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002237620608Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:24:21.338657+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "85986a2c83a6672fc69488dcf4d0ccfb5f3b312a502453007dc7307cab20fac8", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002237620608Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "06ebbc73f52ef4e6943648e3a0028d1a16b623dd505e433a953d615472404f8c"}}}
